OL,3,GNEWSAIncrease in ticket sales at
OL,4,Athree-day city festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew figures show ticket sales for this
OL,7,Fyear's Darley Park Weekender in Derby
OL,8,Fhave increased following a significant
OL,9,Fdrop last year.
OL,11,FFigures provided to the BBC show 10,372
OL,12,Ftickets were sold across the three-day
OL,13,Fseries of concerts from 21 to 23 August
OL,14,Fthis year, compared to just more than
OL,15,F6,000 in 2025. In 2024, 11,000 were
OL,16,Fsold and 15,000 were purchased in 2023.
OL,18,FDerby City Council said Friday night
OL,19,Fwas sold-out this year with 5,175
OL,20,Ftickets bought, while 2,452 tickets
OL,21,Fwere purchased for Saturday and 2,745
OL,22,Ffor Sunday.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
