OL,3,GNEWSAIncrease in ticket sales at
OL,4,Athree-day city festival
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Gurkiran Kaur said: "It was
OL,7,Fwonderful to see people of all ages
OL,8,Fcoming together with friends and family
OL,9,Fto enjoy live music in one of our
OL,10,Fbeautiful parks."
